A||||19||Cozmo||Are we finally getting recognition?||||14||
Z||000000||Cozmo||07-01-2001||07:35 AM||||We had a multi-club road trip yesterday (Suncoast, Spacecoast and Central Florida Fieros) to Tarpon Springs for food and fun.  There were about 15 cars, a beautiful day and drive!  As part of our itinerary, we stopped at a classic car museum that has over 170 really beautiful mint cars of all types ($3 million in inventory). <BR>Here is the "Pride" pulled up in front of the museum:<BR> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/Mvc-319f.jpg"> <BR>Well guess what we found inside the museum in the company of classic Cadillacs, Yenco Camaros and Shelby GT500s?<BR><B>A FIERO!!!</B><BR> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/Mvc-341f.jpg"> <BR>It was an '88 GT 2.8 turbo with IRM integrated rockers claiming 230HP in blood red!<BR>Needless to say, the entire group descended upon it in earnest...<BR>It was nice, no one recognized the turbo setup (looked custom) but all in all it was not as nice as many of the club members cars. (BTW, when we pulled into the parking lot, the employees came out to see what all the noise and commotion was about).<BR>We were all "proud" to see our cool little car represented with some of the finest cars ever built.  Maybe this means we are finally getting recognition for our beloved orphans???<BR>It was a fun day...  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/biggrin.gif"><BR><B>C02M0</B> ||||reg||14
Z||000001||88CoupeV6||07-01-2001||08:07 AM||||Sounded like you had a blast. I love going on road trips, You get the best reactions from the people you pass. <P>------------------<BR>Josh <B>(known by TheFiero64 for first 1239 posts)</B><BR>     <IMG SRC="http://people.ne.mediaone.net/fiero64/Fiero642.jpg">    <BR><A HREF="http://albums.photopoint.com/j/AlbumList?u=1249362" TARGET=_blank>My pics</A>||||reg||7
Z||000002||beachbomb||07-01-2001||08:54 AM||||Outstanding!!! Hey Cozmo, is that classic car place in Daytona, i've been meaning to go there but never got the time, plmk, thanks..jim (2 '84 Indys)<BR> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/sigzach_3.JPG"> ||||reg||1
Z||000003||88formula||07-01-2001||09:04 AM||||WOW! Someone recognized that the GT fastback fiero is an example of classic American Muscle, and it is.  Maybe the person responsible for the cars in that museum is a fiero enthusiast himself.  <P>------------------<BR>  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/88formula_logo_1.JPG"> ||||reg||1
