Z||000015||kslish||07-03-2001||03:30 AM|||| <BLOCKQUOTE><font size="1" face="Verdana, Arial, Helvetica">quote:</font><HR>Originally posted by ChadMan:<BR><B>CRAP!  My wife and I just got back from a week's vacation in Clearwater, and we went up to Tarpon for gyros on Thursday.  We saw that dealership and I wanted to stop, but it was pouring down rain and the dealership looked closed.</B><HR></BLOCKQUOTE><P><BR>I know where that dealership is too...been past it numerous times when I go to Clearwater on vacation every once in a while but I never thought about stopping.  Tarpon Springs is the bomb for greek cuisine though, especially by the sponge docks.<P><P>------------------<BR>Ken S.<BR>'87GT and '86SC<BR>See them at <A HREF="http://homepage.mac.com/kjslish/Fiero.html" TARGET=_blank>http://homepage.mac.com/kjslish/Fiero.html</A><BR>Western PA Fiero Club - <A HREF="http://www.westpennfiero.org" TARGET=_blank>www.westpennfiero.org</A>||||reg||1
